      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To sharply distinguish them, focus on signs of constant physical strain: hardened, leathery skin etched with deep lines from unfiltered atmosphere, and often prominent, dusty features. Their hair could be practical and unstyled, frequently interwoven with pieces of salvage or industrial grit. Furthermore, visible patches of finely woven, utilitarian garments patched together from disparate materials would instantly communicate their tenuous existence.",
